                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f6db6f4-2bee-31b6-a0de-733c69bf573e",
                                        "entry_id": "5a0f5f8a-e755-35db-a1b2-b997e97d2b07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A prefecture-level city in northwestern Jiangsu, China."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2016d2e-2adb-429a-b3af-a32f1f8d97f0",
                                                "sense_id": "8f6db6f4-2bee-31b6-a0de-733c69bf573e",
                                                "text": "T’ung-shan County in the Hsüchou district of Kiangsu was apparently famous for nonglutenous rice during the Han and Northern Wei dynasties (third century B.C. to third century A.D.)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c260735-ff90-4d35-a325-d6bf126aec29",
                                                "sense_id": "8f6db6f4-2bee-31b6-a0de-733c69bf573e",
                                                "text": "Earlier this week, 16 foreign teachers and three Chinese were arrested on drug charges at a local language school in Xuzhou, around 370 miles (600 kilometers) southwest of Yantai. On Friday, the British embassy in Beijing said four of its nationals had been arrested Jiangsu province, where Xuzhou is located."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c73365ac-af7b-42eb-a324-38221712bef9",
                                                "sense_id": "8f6db6f4-2bee-31b6-a0de-733c69bf573e",
                                                "text": "To that end, he said, he planned an overhaul of the company’s ownership this autumn. The city of Xuzhou would retain 34 percent ownership in the company while surrounding Jiangsu Province would obtain 17 percent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
